    "state": "open",
    "state_reason": null,
    "title": "fuzz: Fix stability, determinism issues",
    "body": "It would be good to track fuzz \"[stability](https://github.com/AFLplusplus/AFLplusplus/blob/stable/docs/FAQ.md#performance)\" and determinism, and fix any issues.\n\nOSS-Fuzz used to have a [table for this](https://oss-fuzz.com/fuzzer-stats?group_by=by-fuzzer&fuzzer=afl&job=afl_asan_bitcoin-core&project=bitcoin-core), but it is [broken](https://github.com/google/oss-fuzz/issues/14199).\n\nSo a new overview table can be found under https://dergoegge.github.io/fuzzor-dashboard/ under \" Harness Status Overview \".\n\nThere is also the [deterministic-fuzz-coverage tool](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/tree/master/contrib/devtools#deterministic-fuzz-coverage).\n\n\n(Rolling this tracking issue over from https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/29018)",
